      "text": "We are going to have a conversation this morning, a conversation on how artificial intelligence is assisting government or facilitating government communication, how it is enhancing it, how it is strengthening it. I'm going to direct in the Ministry of Information, Publicity and Broadcasting Services, the government of Zimbabwe. So what we have noticed is that the advent of artificial intelligence has assisted in transforming the whole landscape of media and communication. And one is transformed our way of gathering the content, number two, the distribution of the content. And number three, the consumption of the content. So what it is done effectively is that it has made accessibility of information far more faster, far more efficient and far more reliable.",
